#: backend/src/jacara/modules/insights/service.py:468
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"审核过的单据导出（JacarandaParse）\n"
"\n"
"{summary}\n"
"\n"
"- files/：原文件。\n"
"- train.jsonl：一行一张单据：OCR 文字（ocr_text）、模型的回答（model_answer）、\n"
"  人审核后的值（truth）、人改了哪些（corrections，含错误类型）、用的模型和提示词版本。\n"
"  可以拿来评测，也可以整理成微调数据。\n"
"- pairs.toml：成对测评清单，放进 data/eval/ 后运行\n"
"  uv run jacara eval pairs --manifest data/eval/这个文件夹/pairs.toml\n"
"  我的模板的定义在 templates/ 里。只占一页的单据才列进去。\n"
"\n"
"这些是你自己的业务数据，请按你们的数据管理规定保存，不要放进代码仓库。\n"
msgstr ""
"Export of reviewed documents (JacarandaParse)\n"
"\n"
"{summary}\n"
"\n"
"- files/: original files.\n"
"- train.jsonl: one document per line: OCR text (ocr_text), the model's answer (model_answer),\n"
"  the reviewed values (truth), what reviewers changed (corrections, with error types), and the model and prompt version used.\n"
"  Use it for evaluation or prepare fine-tuning data from it.\n"
"- pairs.toml: paired evaluation manifest; put it into data/eval/ and run\n"
"  uv run jacara eval pairs --manifest data/eval/THIS_FOLDER/pairs.toml\n"
"  Definitions of my templates are in templates/. Only single-page documents are listed.\n"
"\n"
"This is your own business data. Store it according to your data management rules and do not put it into a code repository.\n"

