#: backend/src/jacara/modules/ocr_samples/det.py:593
msgid "- `images/`：整页图（PDF 按 216 DPI 画、照片按 EXIF 转正），文件名只是编号。"
msgstr "- `images/`: full-page images (PDFs rendered at 216 DPI, photos rotated by EXIF); file names are only numbers."

