#, python-brace-format
msgid "- `det_gt_*.txt`：每行一页，图片路径、一个 Tab、这页所有框的 JSON：`[{\"transcription\": \"图上的字\", \"points\": [[x, y], [x, y], [x, y], [x, y]]}]`，四个角从左上开始顺时针，`###` 是看不清、不参与训练的框。"
msgstr "- `det_gt_*.txt`: one page per line: image path, a Tab, and the JSON of all boxes on the page: `[{\"transcription\": \"text on the image\", \"points\": [[x, y], [x, y], [x, y], [x, y]]}]`, corners clockwise from the top left; `###` marks illegible boxes excluded from training."

