msgstr "- `manifest.jsonl`: per page: group id, split, revision, box count, source, and the OCR version used for pre-annotation."

#: backend/src/jacara/modules/ocr_samples/det.py:599
msgid "## 在 PaddleOCR 里训练检测模型"
msgstr "## Training a detection model with PaddleOCR"

#: backend/src/jacara/modules/ocr_samples/det.py:601
msgid "1. 解压到一个文件夹，例如 `/data/jacara_det`。"
msgstr "1. Extract into a folder, for example `/data/jacara_det`."

#: backend/src/jacara/modules/ocr_samples/det.py:603
msgid "2. 检测训练配置里：`Train.dataset.data_dir`、`Eval.dataset.data_dir` 写这个文件夹，`Train.dataset.label_file_list` 写 `det_gt_train.txt`，`Eval.dataset.label_file_list` 写 `det_gt_val.txt`。用 PaddleX 训练时，按 PaddleX 文档把它们改名成 `train.txt`、`val.txt`，图片文件夹叫 `images`。"
msgstr "2. In the detection training configuration, set `Train.dataset.data_dir` and `Eval.dataset.data_dir` to this folder, `Train.dataset.label_file_list` to `det_gt_train.txt` and `Eval.dataset.label_file_list` to `det_gt_val.txt`. When training with PaddleX, rename them to `train.txt` and `val.txt` as described in the PaddleX documentation; the image folder is `images`."

#: backend/src/jacara/modules/ocr_samples/det.py:606
msgid "3. 用和系统现在用的检测模型同一系列的配置和预训练权重微调；训练好后导出推理模型，用 `paddlex --paddle2onnx` 转成 ONNX，在“模型和数据集”页导入（种类选“OCR 文字检测”）。"
msgstr "3. Fine-tune with the configuration and pretrained weights of the same series as the detection model currently in use; after training, export the inference model, convert it to ONNX with `paddlex --paddle2onnx`, and import it on the \"Models and datasets\" page (kind \"OCR text detection\")."

#: backend/src/jacara/modules/ocr_samples/det.py:608
msgid "4. 换上去之前，先在数据集库里用验证集或锁定测试集评测，和现在用的比一比。"
msgstr "4. Before switching, evaluate it in the dataset library on the validation or locked test set and compare it with the current model."

