msgstr "- {name}: {groups} groups (independent business documents), {rows} lines (`rec_gt_{split}.txt`)"

#: backend/src/jacara/modules/ocr_samples/service.py:1360
msgid "按单据分组：同一张单据（重新处理的几轮、PDF 和照片、重复上传的同一个文件）的样本全在同一边，多次导出始终在同一边（`document_group` 是稳定的组号，不含业务信息）。80/20 是按组的目标比例，组少时行数比例会偏。`rec_gt.txt` 是训练集和验证集合起来。锁定测试集不在这里，单独导出。"
msgstr "Grouped by document: all samples of one document (several runs, PDF and photo, repeated uploads of the same file) are in the same split, and stay there across exports (`document_group` is a stable group id without business information). 80/20 is the target ratio by group; with few groups the line ratio may deviate. `rec_gt.txt` combines training and validation. The locked test set is not included; export it separately."

#: backend/src/jacara/modules/ocr_samples/service.py:1367
msgid "- `crop_img/`：每条一张单行小图，文件名只是编号。"
msgstr "- `crop_img/`: one single-line image per sample; file names are only numbers."

#: backend/src/jacara/modules/ocr_samples/service.py:1368
msgid "- `rec_gt_*.txt`：每行一条，图片路径、一个 Tab、图上原样的文字（UTF-8，无 BOM）。"
msgstr "- `rec_gt_*.txt`: one sample per line: image path, a Tab, and the text exactly as on the image (UTF-8, no BOM)."

#: backend/src/jacara/modules/ocr_samples/service.py:1370
msgid "- `manifest.jsonl`：每行一条的详细信息：OCR 当时读成什么（`ocr_text`）、分类、错误标签、模板、字段、组号、分在哪边（`split`）、划分版本、标签修订号（`sample_revision`）、来源、首轮 OCR 的版本。"
msgstr "- `manifest.jsonl`: details per sample: what OCR read at the time (`ocr_text`), category, error tags, template, field, group id, split (`split`), split version, label revision (`sample_revision`), source, and the OCR version of the first run."

