msgstr "Misread and missed text are error cases; correct lines were checked during review and OCR read them correctly. Fine-tune with error cases and correct lines together; with error cases only, the model \"forgets\" text it used to read well. Undetermined cases: the image differs from the first OCR run; inspect them before deciding whether to use them."

