msgid "2. 识别训练配置里：`Train.dataset.data_dir` 和 `Eval.dataset.data_dir` 写这个文件夹，`Train.dataset.label_file_list` 写 `rec_gt_train.txt`，`Eval.dataset.label_file_list` 写 `rec_gt_val.txt`（`SimpleDataSet` 直接能读）。"
msgstr "2. In the recognition training configuration, set `Train.dataset.data_dir` and `Eval.dataset.data_dir` to this folder, `Train.dataset.label_file_list` to `rec_gt_train.txt` and `Eval.dataset.label_file_list` to `rec_gt_val.txt` (`SimpleDataSet` reads them directly)."

#: backend/src/jacara/modules/ocr_samples/service.py:1430
msgid "3. 用和系统现在用的识别模型同一系列的配置、字典和预训练权重做微调；字典里没有的字训练时会被跳过，最好先检查一遍。"
msgstr "3. Fine-tune with the configuration, dictionary and pretrained weights of the same series as the recognition model currently in use; characters missing from the dictionary are skipped during training, so check first."

#: backend/src/jacara/modules/ocr_samples/service.py:1433
msgid "4. 训练好后导出推理模型、转成 ONNX，放进项目的 `models/ocr/`（文件名带 rec），在系统信息页\"换模型\"里选上，jacara stop、jacara start 后生效。"
msgstr "4. After training, export the inference model, convert it to ONNX, put it into the project's `models/ocr/` (with rec in the file name), select it under \"Change model\" on the system information page; it takes effect after jacara stop and jacara start."

#: backend/src/jacara/modules/ocr_samples/service.py:1437
msgid "反复看验证集的结果来调训练，验证集会慢慢\"被调过\"；正式验收用锁定测试集，或者新进的单据。"
msgstr "Tuning training by repeatedly looking at validation results gradually \"overfits\" the validation set; use the locked test set or newly arriving documents for final acceptance."

#: backend/src/jacara/modules/ocr_samples/service.py:1440
msgid "## 数量和配比（PaddleOCR 微调文档的建议）"
msgstr "## Amounts and mixing ratios (recommendations from the PaddleOCR fine-tuning documentation)"

#: backend/src/jacara/modules/ocr_samples/service.py:1443
#, python-brace-format
msgid "- 不改字典时，识别数据建议至少 {minimum} 行；这次 {n} 行，还不够，先攒或按下面合成补。"
msgstr "- Without changing the dictionary, at least {minimum} lines of recognition data are recommended; this export has {n}, which is not enough yet: collect more or synthesize as described below."

#: backend/src/jacara/modules/ocr_samples/service.py:1449
#, python-brace-format
msgid "- 不改字典时，识别数据建议至少 {minimum} 行；这次 {n} 行。"
msgstr "- Without changing the dictionary, at least {minimum} lines of recognition data are recommended; this export has {n}."

#: backend/src/jacara/modules/ocr_samples/service.py:1454
msgid "- 这些场景数据和通用的真实数据（例如 LSVT、RCTW、MTWI）每轮大约 1:1 混着训练，用 `Train.dataset.ratio_list` 调（例如场景 1.0、通用 0.1），免得只认得这一种单据。"
msgstr "- Mix this scenario data with general real-world data (for example LSVT, RCTW, MTWI) at about 1:1 per epoch, adjusted with `Train.dataset.ratio_list` (for example scenario 1.0, general 0.1), so the model does not recognize only this kind of document."

#: backend/src/jacara/modules/ocr_samples/service.py:1457
msgid "- 某些字老认错时，用 TextRenderer 这类工具合成补充：语料用 `corpus/real_text.txt`（图上原样的文字），重点合成 `corpus/hard_chars.txt` 里的字；原有数据和合成数据的比例 10:1 到 5:1，学习率调小。"
msgstr "- When certain characters are misread repeatedly, synthesize more with tools such as TextRenderer: use `corpus/real_text.txt` (text exactly as on the images) as the corpus and focus on the characters in `corpus/hard_chars.txt`; keep the ratio of real to synthetic data between 10:1 and 5:1 and lower the learning rate."

#: backend/src/jacara/modules/ocr_samples/service.py:1459
msgid "- 训练出来的模型先用回放（jacara eval replay）和锁定测试集比过，再换上去。"
msgstr "- Compare the trained model with replay (jacara eval replay) and on the locked test set before switching to it."

